ief executive, publicly frets about the dangers of artificial intelligence and has made enemies of his peers along the way.</description><dc:creator>Kalley Huang, Mike Isaac and Cecilia Kang</dc:creator><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:09:04 GMT</pubDate><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Artificial intelligence</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Computers and the Internet</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Tech Industry</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Regulation and Deregulation</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">NVIDIA</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">OpenAI</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Windsurf</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Microsoft</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Dario Amodei</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Marc L Andreessen</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Jen-Hsun Huang</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Jensen Huang</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Satya Nadella</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Ben Horowitz</category><media:content url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/09/03/business/00anthropic-knives-out/00anthropic-knives-out-videoSixteenByNineJumbo1600.jpg" medium="image"><media:credit>Timo Lenzen</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Microsoft Says Outage Disrupting Outlook Is Improving</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/12/business/microsoft-outlook-down-outage-email.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss