ds/nyt_des">Donald Trump</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Jen-Hsun Huang</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Jensen Huang</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Alice Huang</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Commerce Department</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">NVIDIA</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Megaspeed</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">Cantor Fitzgerald</category><category domain="http://www.nytimes.com/namespaces/keywords/nyt_des">China</category><media:content url="https://static01.nyt.com/images/2026/11/12/multimedia/12dc-commerce-nvidia-fzpt/12dc-commerce-nvidia-fzpt-videoSixteenByNineJumbo1600.jpg" medium="image"><media:credit>Doug Mills/The New York Times</media:credit><media:description>Howard Lutnick has frequently clashed with top officials over how to regulate sales of advanced technology to Asia, particularly Nvidia’s chip sales in the region.</media:description></media:content></item><item><title>Nvidia Scandal Unleashes a Flood of AI-Generated Memes</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/12/world/asia/nvidia-ceo-huang-ai-memes.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/12/world/asia/nvidia-ceo-huang-ai-memes.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss</guid><atom:link rel="standout" href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/12/world/asia/nvidia-ceo-huang-ai-memes.html?partner=rss&amp;emc=rss" /><description>The revelations surrounding Jensen Huang, who resigned from Nvidia over extramarital affairs, inspired social media posts using the very technology his company helped develop.</description><dc:creator>Zane Irwin</dc:creator><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 22:40:12 GMT</pubDate><category domain="http://w